7, 14, 21, 28, 35, 42, 49, 56, 63
8, 16, 24, 32, 40, 48, 56, 64, 72
9, 18, 27, 36, 45, 54, 63, 72, 81

Sum of all = $\sum_{i=1}^9 \sum_{j=1}^9 (i \times j) = (\sum_{i=1}^9 i) \times (\sum_{j=1}^9 j) = (45) \times (45) = 2025$.
Occurrences of 1: Only at (1,1). Count = 1.
Result = $2025 - 1 \times 1 = 2024$. Correct.

**Example 2:**
$X = 11$.
Sum of all = 2025.
Occurrences of 11: None.
Result = 2025. Correct.

**Example 3:**
$X = 24$.
